Package: mtp
Version: 1.1.0
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-numpy, ffmpeg, alsa-utils | pipewire-pulseaudio
Maintainer: Pirate85 <Pirate85@web.de>
Description: MinimalTouchPlayer — minimalist touch music player
 A square, dark-themed desktop music player with large touch-friendly buttons and no album art.
 Supports MP3, FLAC, OGG, Opus, M4A/AAC, WAV, WMA, AIFF, APE, WebM.
 Features: folder picker, live volume control, seek bar, position resume,
 bilingual UI (DE/EN), keyboard shortcuts, zoom support.
